---
/** AboutStats — exact copy of S03Stats with Why Credo content */
const image = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/credo/about-stats-bg.webp`;
---

<!-- Section 03 — Stats | Figma: fileKey=RxueMLDFnpgheWZp4MVk7f nodeId=8:30 -->
<section data-figma-ref="8:30" class="bg-navy pt-28 pb-12 sm:pt-32 sm:pb-20 lg:pt-32 lg:pb-28 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center pointer-events-none"
    style={`background-image: url('${image}'); mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0%, transparent 50%, black 90%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0%, transparent 50%, black 90%);`}
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-navy/65 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="max-w-[1232px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 relative z-10">
    <!-- Section label -->
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-accent mb-4">How I work</p>
    <div class="w-12 h-0.5 bg-accent mb-12 sm:mb-16"></div>

    <!-- 2-col grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-24">
      <!-- Left: heading -->
      <div>
        <h2 data-reveal class="font-heading font-medium text-white text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl leading-tight mb-6">
          Independent. Honest. One point of contact.
        </h2>
        <p data-reveal="fade" style="--reveal-delay: 200ms;" class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
          I started Credo FS because I got tired of watching good operators get a raw deal. I've sat where you're sitting. I've had the card machine go down on a Saturday night. I know what that moment feels like, and I know what it means when someone actually picks up the phone.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: stat rows -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-8" data-reveal-group="wide">
        <!-- Stat 1 -->
        <div data-reveal class="border-b border-accent pb-8">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-medium text-white text-lg mb-2">No commission from a single brand</h3>
          <p class="text-white/70 text-sm mb-4">
            I work with Square, Teya, Sunmi, Elavon, Shift4, Loyverse, and others, because different businesses need different things, and the right answer for your pub isn't necessarily the right answer for the one down the road.
          </p>
          <p class="font-heading font-medium text-accent text-5xl sm:text-6xl"><span data-counter data-target="100" data-suffix="%">0%</span></p>
        </div>

        <!-- Stat 2 -->
        <div data-reveal class="border-b border-accent pb-8">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-medium text-white text-lg mb-2">A relationship, not a product</h3>
          <p class="text-white/70 text-sm mb-4">
            When something goes wrong, and in hospitality, something always does, you call me. Not a helpline. Not a chatbot. Not a number that rings out. Me.
          </p>
          <p class="font-heading font-medium text-accent text-5xl sm:text-6xl"><span data-counter data-target="1" data-suffix=" number">0 number</span></p>
        </div>

        <!-- Stat 3 -->
        <div data-reveal class="border-b border-accent pb-8">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-medium text-white text-lg mb-2">Word of mouth</h3>
          <p class="text-white/70 text-sm mb-4">
            About 70% of the people I work with came through a recommendation from someone I'd already helped. I don't run ads or cold-call anyone. I just do the work properly and let people talk.
          </p>
          <p class="font-heading font-medium text-accent text-5xl sm:text-6xl"><span data-counter data-target="70" data-suffix="%">0%</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
